      <p source="#source-481-516"><seg source="#source-481-516">たとふれば戦ひ果てぬ、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-516-566"><seg source="#source-516-531">日は暮れて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-531-555"><rb>二時</rb><rt>ふたとき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-555-566">を経ぬ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-566-625"><seg source="#source-566-581">なまぐさき</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-581-602"><rb>荒野</rb><rt>あらの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-602-605">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-605-620"><rb>中</rb><rt>なか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-620-625">に</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-625-684"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-625-640"><rb>双</rb><rt>さう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-640-649">の眼を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-649-667"><rb>弾丸</rb><rt>たま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-667-684">に射られて</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-684-734"><seg source="#source-684-696">なほ黒き</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-696-717"><rb>呻吟</rb><rt>うめき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-717-734">をしのび、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-734-781"><seg source="#source-734-749">よこたはる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-749-770"><rb>負傷</rb><rt>いたで</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-770-781">の兵の</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-781-810"><seg source="#source-781-810">勇しきわかき心に、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-810-878"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-810-822"><rb>秘</rb><rt>ひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-822-834">めつゝむ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-834-858"><rb>苦痛</rb><rt>くるしみ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-858-873"><rb>遂</rb><rt>つひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-873-878">に</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-878-952"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-878-902"><rb>鈍色</rb><rt>にびいろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-902-905">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-905-932"><rb>寂寞</rb><rt>じやくまく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-932-935">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-935-947"><rb>気</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-947-952">を</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-952-995"><seg source="#source-952-995">吸ふがごと嗚呼われこゝに。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-995-1042"><seg source="#source-995-1022">くらがりの冷えたる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1022-1037"><rb>室</rb><rt>むろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1037-1042">に</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1042-1080"><seg source="#source-1042-1080">ひとり居ておもひ沈めば、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1080-1151"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1080-1104"><rb>空想</rb><rt>くうさう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1104-1107">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1107-1128"><rb>蠑螺</rb><rt>さゞえ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1128-1131">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1131-1146"><rb>殻</rb><rt>から</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1146-1151">の</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1151-1198"><seg source="#source-1151-1157">底つ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1157-1172"><rb>闇</rb><rt>やみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1172-1198">たどるがごとく、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1198-1260"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1198-1222"><rb>鬱憂</rb><rt>うつゆう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1222-1231">ははた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1231-1255"><rb>南蛮</rb><rt>なんばん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1255-1260">の</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1260-1313"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1260-1275"><rb>夜</rb><rt>よる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1275-1281">深き</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1281-1302"><rb>荒磯</rb><rt>ありそ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1302-1313">の上に</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1313-1378"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1313-1325"><rb>鋭</rb><rt>と</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1325-1328">き</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1328-1343"><rb>銛</rb><rt>もり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1343-1346">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1346-1364"><rb>腮</rb><rt>あぎと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1364-1378">にうけて</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1378-1425"><seg source="#source-1378-1387">横はる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1387-1420"><rb>粗膚鮫</rb><rt>あらはだざめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1420-1425">の</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1425-1490"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1425-1455"><rb>断末魔</rb><rt>だんまつま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1455-1473">――濁りゆく</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1473-1485"><rb>眼</rb><rt>め</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1485-1490">に</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1490-1542"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1490-1511"><rb>無辺</rb><rt>むへん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1511-1542">なる闇を見るごと。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1542-1592"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1542-1557"><rb>愛</rb><rt>あい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1557-1566">消えし</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1566-1581"><rb>人</rb><rt>ひと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1581-1592">の心は</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1592-1645"><seg source="#source-1592-1604">霜の夜の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1604-1622"><rb>渚</rb><rt>なぎさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1622-1625">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1625-1640"><rb>泥</rb><rt>ひぢ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1640-1645">に</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1645-1707"><seg source="#source-1645-1660">まみれたる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1660-1684"><rb>寄居蟹</rb><rt>がうな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1684-1687">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1687-1702"><rb>殻</rb><rt>から</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1702-1707">の</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1707-1757"><seg source="#source-1707-1719">冷やかに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1719-1734"><rb>凍</rb><rt>こほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1734-1757">れたるごとし、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1757-1819"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1757-1781"><rb>土色</rb><rt>つちいろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1781-1790">にはた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1790-1814"><rb>青銅</rb><rt>せいどう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1814-1819">の</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1819-1878"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1819-1843"><rb>巨鐘</rb><rt>おほがね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1843-1846">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1846-1861"><rb>銹</rb><rt>さび</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1861-1878">のやうなる</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1878-1946"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1878-1905"><rb>寂寞</rb><rt>じやくまく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1905-1908">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1908-1932"><rb>五百重</rb><rt>いほへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1932-1946">のなかに</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1946-2002"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1946-1973"><rb>一瞬</rb><rt>いつしゆん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1973-2002">も千とせのおもひ、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-2002-2052"><seg source="#source-2002-2023">あゝかゝる日の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2023-2047"><rb>凶時</rb><rt>まがどき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2047-2052">に</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-2052-2097"><seg source="#source-2052-2073">人は死に、花は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2073-2088"><rb>萎</rb><rt>しを</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2088-2097">れめ。</seg></p>
    </body>
